    "desc": "Autumn in NewZealand.南半球的秋天\n风是轻的 云是慢的\n赶上一个好天气\n和朋友们漫步皇后镇\n雪山、湖泊、日出与秋色相拥\n我们踩碎满地落叶\n看着跑步的人从身边经过\n好像感受到了从未有过的轻松自在\n🍂\n—————————————————————\nAutumn in the Southern Hemisphere\nThe wind is light. The clouds are slow.\nWe catch a perfect day,\nstrolling through Queenstown with friends.\nSnow-capped mountains, still lakes, sunrise, and autumn colors all around.\nWe crunch through fallen leaves,\nwatching runners pass us by,\nand for a moment, we feel a kind of ease and freedom we've never known before.\n-\n📍皇后镇Queenstown\n📷2026.4.17\n#一张图证明你是摄影师 #南半球的秋天 #拍出电影感 #新西兰旅行 #每一帧都是壁纸",
